{
  "name": "Lead to Google Sheets and Telegram alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Lead to Google Sheets and Telegram alert\n\nReceives a lead, **saves it to Google Sheets** and **pings you on Telegram** right away.\n\n**How it works:** the webhook receives the lead, checks the email, normalizes the fields, appends a row and sends you a Telegram message.\n\n**You need:** a **Google Sheets** credential and a **Telegram bot** (free, created with @BotFather).\n\n**Setup:** follow steps 1 to 3 below.\n\nFree template from kyndredai.com/templates. Runs on n8n 2.x, self-hosted or cloud.",
        "height": 291,
        "width": 1260,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        49
      ],
      "id": "8a482feb-a726-47a5-84cb-a446dc7e7138",
      "name": "README"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-telegram",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "id": "b127362b-3c87-4bf3-8709-44c912c029df",
      "name": "Receive lead (Webhook)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "464de430-37df-4778-8439-e7d8ddedcfcb",
              "leftValue": "={{ String($json.body.email || '').trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ],
      "id": "c7feef80-f841-42d8-a6b8-b82c85c88c33",
      "name": "Has a valid email?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "8939ccb0-1c2a-4fc9-8063-a70218f33eb6",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.name || '').trim().slice(0, 100) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2bbc79aa-1df5-4513-886d-d7a3705b63e3",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.email).trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0db4edf1-3544-4944-8d58-8b6e58110d56",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.message || '').trim().slice(0, 2000) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5c4587a6-60df-43ea-8006-e859c2d2dcf7",
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ],
      "id": "51c77fcf-6ede-4704-bda2-da88422fdd0f",
      "name": "Normalize fields"
    },
    {
