    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Connect your form\n\nPoint your form or landing page at this webhook URL (method **POST**, JSON body).\n\nExpected fields in the body:\n- name\n- email\n- message\n\nThe webhook has no authentication. Before going live, add Header Auth on the webhook node and send the same header from your form backend.\n\n*Tip:* click **Listen for test event** and send a test POST.",
        "height": 438,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        800
      ],
      "id": "40b387de-7935-470e-9810-f61bbe065965",
      "name": "Setup 1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Validation\n\nSubmissions without a well-formed email go to the discard branch, so they never become rows. Name and message are trimmed and cut at 100 and 2,000 characters.",
        "height": 207,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        310,
        800
      ],
      "id": "1fd26fe4-4493-4ddb-a39c-675e2d87ab4a",
      "name": "Validation note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Connect Google Sheets\n\n*Save to Google Sheets*, Credential, your Google account, then the document and the sheet. Mapping is **Map Automatically**.\n\nHeaders: **name, email, message, received_at**",
        "height": 249,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        800
      ],
      "id": "45abb18b-6470-4d76-973c-6fa398e04130",
      "name": "Setup 2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Connect Telegram\n\n1. Create a bot with **@BotFather**. It gives you a *token*: put it in the Telegram credential.\n2. Send any message to your bot, then open `https://api.telegram.org/bot<token>/getUpdates`. Your chat id is `message.chat.id`.\n3. Replace `YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` in *Alert on Telegram*.\n\nThe message is plain text (no parse mode), so names with `_` or `*` do not break it.",
        "height": 375,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1010,
        800
      ],
      "id": "21d42f68-4e4c-43b1-b261-cc02934c5a8b",
      "name": "Setup 3"
    }
  ],
